  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Build a regression model to help you predict student ratings for the following snacks: \r\n- Bananas, Sour Patch Kids, Apple Slices, Rice Krispies Treats, Oreos, Reese's Peanut Butter Cups, Welch's Fruit Snacks, Chobani Yogurt Cup, Takis Fuego, Flamin' Hot Cheetos. \r\n\r\nThe 5 snacks with the highest predicted rating will be stocked in the vending machine. \r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Choose one characteristic from the list and pass it to the train_model function.\r\n- Spend some time looking at the model and its predictions for which snacks will have the highest ratings. \r\n- Test out a few different characteristics and decide which results in the “best” predictions. ",
